  "novel_mechanics_found": "No new winning mechanic was confirmed. I tested a substantial route-shortening hypothesis: deform each rectangle to 22x4 directly from its spawn, use the safe y=15..18 corridor, compress to 4x22 at the upper fixture, cross the x=44..49 opening, and restore at the lower fixture. This reduced the attempted L8 tail from the prior 269 actions to 170, but placing both pieces at the expected target lattice positions did not trigger a win.",
